The fragment shader of dEQP-GLES2.functional.shaders.indexing.tmp_array.vec3_static_loop_write_dynamic_loop_read_fragment as dEQP-GLES2 writes it, rebuilt from the templates of es2fShaderIndexingTests.cpp (VK-GL-CTS 93bca01) for docs/notes/mali-deqp-idxloc.md, not taken from a .qpa. Every other line is the template's as the 27 verbatim .qpa copies under tools/mali/testdata (deqp_loops2_*idx*, deqp_loops_*idx*, ...) show it byte for byte.
